*CLASS E-Finder*

​# What's the problem?

​Finding an empty classroom on campus is always a headache. Students and lecturers often waste a lot of time walking around different blocks just to check if a room is free for a quick study session, makeup class, or meeting. Sometimes, they even walk into a room only to find another class is already using it.

​# Our Solution: Class-E-Find

​Class-E-Find is a simple app that shows everyone in real-time which classrooms are free and which ones are taken.

​# Main Features

​Live Room Status: See a live list or map showing which rooms are open, occupied, or booked for later.

​Instant Notifications: Get alerts on your phone when a classroom opens up or if your lecture venue changes.

​Quick Bookings: Lecturers and class reps can book an open room instantly so no one else takes it.

​Smart Filters: Search for rooms based on your building, how many seats you need, or if you need a projector/whiteboard.

​# Who is it for?

​Students: To easily find empty spaces for group work or studying.

​Lecturers & Class Reps: To quickly find and book alternative venues for classes.

​School Admin: To manage timetables and keep track of campus rooms.



